<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"0bfb6f3dfc21" class=
=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dc2477d1726c"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"e8ce535d-dae0-4c45-960f-2cc27278084e">One liner</span></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3c3daa47f8c0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"abff2a6a2797"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"b5de11a8-fbe1-4ded-907e-0243ee760c77">Hypothesis: We think that by list=
ing Sinch as a Power in AWS's Kiro agentic IDE, it will place Sinch's messa=
ging, verification and communications APIs in front of AWS-ecosystem develo=
pers and AI agents at the moment they build, increasing Sinch's marketplace=
 presence and developer-led adoption, resulting in an increase in account s=
ign-ups, and opening the door to potential partnership discussions with AWS=
. </span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"557ac66f20c6">
