<h3 local-id=3D"18fe398b6e31" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-OPPORTUNITYDEFINITION"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" d=
ata-ref=3D"3f474bf5-eb38-4ef6-9dbb-dce9c6926478">OPPORTUNITY DEFINITION</sp=
an></h3>
<p local-id=3D"63e543d508df"><em>What is the opportunity or problem we shou=
ld solve, for whom and why?</em></p>
<h4 local-id=3D"cbca2c3f7949" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Articulatetheproblemwewanttosolveandwhy">Articulate the proble=
m we want to solve and why</h4>
<p local-id=3D"f22f65dd1972">Developers are increasingly building inside ag=
entic IDEs, and AWS Kiro is a fast-growing, enterprise-grade entrant in tha=
t category (spec-driven, running on Amazon Bedrock, deeply tied into the AW=
S builder ecosystem). Kiro's "Powers" marketplace lets partners surface the=
ir APIs directly inside the developer's workflow. Sinch has no presence the=
re, while a direct competitor - Vonage - became the first CPaaS in Kiro on =
18 June 2026. <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"7f06e778-fc=
d0-4b47-9423-1abaa96cef09">Every week Sinch is absent, AWS-ecosystem develo=
pers and AI agents provision communications through whoever is discoverable=
 at the point of building, which is currently Vonage. This is a distributio=
n and marketplace-listing gap on a surface that maps exactly to the team's =
remit.</span></p>
<p local-id=3D"9f85c17fd15c">Solving this gap should benefit Sinch at least=
 in two ways:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"3a3df92f93f9">
<li local-id=3D"3a9c27380149">
<p local-id=3D"edf78648cc54">Discoverability/brand awareness - we=E2=80=99v=
e already seen Sinch=E2=80=99s discoverability increase over the last coupl=
e of quarters, which can=E2=80=99t only be attributed to marketplace listin=
gs, however it isn=E2=80=99t coincidental that Sinch is now showing where i=
t previously was not. Additionally, this demonstrates Sinch=E2=80=99s inves=
tment and leadership in the AX/DX space, which reflects positively within G=
artner reviews as an example</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b2445493e77a">
<p local-id=3D"112eca638fda">Driving Build account sign-ups - being availab=
le within the marketplace, and visible to developers is key.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"ff7fc7913dde" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Definethetargetcustomeranduser">Define the target customer and=
 user</h4>
<p local-id=3D"3dae501b77d8"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"8720b7e8-ed69-45b4-98c6-9aba908a94ba">Enterprise and individual develop=
ers building in Kiro / the AWS builder ecosystem, "vibe-coders" prototyping=
 with agentic tooling, and the AI agents that provision messaging, verifica=
tion and communications on a developer's behalf.</span></p>
<h4 local-id=3D"d35c7ab5c1ac" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Estimatethemarketandcustomerdemand">Estimate the market and cu=
stomer demand</h4>
<p local-id=3D"5b9a41270ea1"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"cf88a6be-21ab-42f4-9f1b-806878cd58e9">Kiro drew more than 250,000 devel=
opers during preview (300M+ requests, trillions of tokens) and is now gener=
ally available with free and paid tiers. Its Powers ecosystem is expanding =
quickly (launch partners include Datadog, Figma, Stripe and Supabase; Hashi=
Corp and AWS Observability added since). The CPaaS category inside Kiro is =
effectively empty - Vonage is the only CPaaS Power today - so this is an op=
en category on a growing surface, not a crowded one. </span></p>
<h4 local-id=3D"dbd5f2350518" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Sharemarketorcustomerinsightsthatvalidatestheopportunity"><spa=
n class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"3905917f-e68c-47f7-8c67-6d12c=
bd2310e">Share market or customer insights that validates the opportunity</=
span></h4>
<p local-id=3D"7cc58809cf44"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"3905917f-e68c-47f7-8c67-6d12cbd2310e">Three signals: </span></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"065e48f53e95">
<li local-id=3D"a88ccedb0397">
<p local-id=3D"a9e041016e2b"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"3905917f-e68c-47f7-8c67-6d12cbd2310e">Vonage's June 2026 launch validat=
es that a CPaaS Power is viable and worth a competitor's investment</span><=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2bfc5eef91a1">
<p local-id=3D"eb98d41e5a48"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"3905917f-e68c-47f7-8c67-6d12cbd2310e">AWS is actively recruiting ISV/pl=
atform partners into Powers, so the door is open</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3ba1e2f7769f">
<p local-id=3D"54c8ab8fd5c5"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"3905917f-e68c-47f7-8c67-6d12cbd2310e">Sinch has already shipped the sam=
e class of listing into six agentic IDEs (Cursor, VSCode/Windsurf, Claude C=
ode, Gemini CLI, Google Antigravity, JetBrains), so the pattern and the und=
erlying assets are proven.</span></p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"cc5bd413ea35" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Requirements,scopeandconsiderationsfortheexpectedsolution">Req=
uirements, scope and considerations for the expected solution</h4>
<p local-id=3D"953d6a3db505"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"d42424ad-aea7-4c23-b738-bb1211b37616">A Kiro Power is a lightweight, MC=
P-based bundle: a </span><code><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-r=
ef=3D"d42424ad-aea7-4c23-b738-bb1211b37616">POWER.md</span></code><span cla=
ss=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"d42424ad-aea7-4c23-b738-bb1211b376=
16"> manifest plus an MCP server, steering files and hooks, published via G=
itHub and installable in one click. Sinch already owns the core building bl=
ocks - an existing </span><code><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-=
ref=3D"d42424ad-aea7-4c23-b738-bb1211b37616">@sinch/mcp</span></code><span =
class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"d42424ad-aea7-4c23-b738-bb1211b=
37616"> server and a skills catalog reused across its other IDE plugins. </=
span></p>
<hr local-id=3D"b5a151e4-071f-4000-b2ee-253613f3f51e">
<h3 local-id=3D"7c3e6cc104aa" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-SOLUTIONDISCOVERY">SOLUTION DISCOVERY</h3>
<p local-id=3D"ca1d8514cf72"><em>How should we solve it and what will it ta=
ke?</em></p>
<h4 local-id=3D"3b3227c5711e" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Proposedtechnicalsolution">Proposed technical solution</h4>
<p local-id=3D"d0dec04545db">Package Sinch's existing MCP server and skills=
 catalog as a Kiro Power (<code>POWER.md</code> manifest, Kiro-format <code=
>mcp.json</code>, and steering files tuned to Kiro's spec-driven workflow).=
 Optionally ship a Sinch documentation MCP server to provide context-aware,=
 in-IDE guidance - the differentiator Vonage led with. This is primarily a =
repackaging of existing assets rather than net-new product.</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"982a0e89aaf8" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Designanduserexperience">Design and user experience</h4>
<p local-id=3D"0a18176620c2">No net-new UI. One-click install from kiro.dev=
, with keyword-triggered activation so the Power loads only when a develope=
r's task is relevant, and in-IDE guidance so developers never leave their w=
orkflow.</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"946e16c30ecd" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Phasesforiterativedelivery">Phases for iterative delivery</h4>
<p local-id=3D"df60ede2ca73">Sequenced, not time-boxed (see EPR-408 for the=
 full validation list):</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"cf5f20b0-20cd-400e-839f-72fea4d2adbb">
<li local-id=3D"78d1baa8-01ff-4917-80d9-3d70974dff5b">
<p local-id=3D"bac3e2449e4c"><strong>Validate before build</strong> - confi=
rm audience relevance and ICP overlap, <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker=
" data-ref=3D"87c2a512-b651-4ecc-a702-8183bc27171d">confirm attribution is =
possible</span>, and run a technical feasibility spike wrapping the existin=
g MCP + skills into a minimal Power.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d01c7836-df40-4969-bace-b684a65b3afd">
<p local-id=3D"e27094d640b2"><strong>Self-published Power</strong> - ship a=
 GitHub-published Power covering a focused, differentiated capability set a=
nd instrument it for measurement.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fa656ffb-6745-4604-bb9f-fdb496df1a4a">
<p local-id=3D"270bb0351be0"><strong>Curated partner listing</strong> - pur=
sue featured placement and co-marketing via AWS Partner Solutions Architect=
, including any Bedrock/Amazon Nova co-build angle.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"0560502b8fd5" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Pricing&amp;Packaging">Pricing &amp; Packaging</h4>
<p local-id=3D"548f2ee80c02">The Power itself is free to install, consisten=
t with Kiro's model. Monetisation is indirect: downstream API consumption, =
new account sign-ups, and first-message/verification events driven by in-ID=
E discovery. Packaging should lead with the capabilities most likely to con=
vert AWS-ecosystem developers (messaging breadth and/or Verify/Number Looku=
p as a fraud-and-identity wedge).</p>
<h4 local-id=3D"95cf2248d9cb" id=3D"On-Pager:SinchBuildavailableforAWSKiroI=
DEDevelopers-Go-to-marketplanning"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" da=
ta-ref=3D"1e1920fb-50f6-4533-985b-5e4451f79806">Go-to-market planning</span=
></h4>
<ul local-id=3D"47fbb606e461">
<li local-id=3D"b79135199279">
<p local-id=3D"16fc2e89feae"><a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" =
data-account-id=3D"712020:f29ce452-7e3e-4c12-8181-0356e99bf753" href=3D"htt=
ps://sinchenterprise.atlassian.net/wiki/people/712020:f29ce452-7e3e-4c12-81=
81-0356e99bf753?ref=3Dconfluence" target=3D"_blank" data-linked-resource-id=
=3D"1559232530" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-typ=
e=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=3D"https://sinchenterprise.atlassian.net/wiki"=
>Gunnar Grosch</a> Engage the AWS Partner Solutions Architect to understand=
 curated placement and co-marketing</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"03a9042d5b12">
<p local-id=3D"94f182c96d86">Coordinate a launch announcement mirroring the=
 competitor's "<a href=3D"https://www.vonage.com/about-us/newsroom/press-re=
leases/Vonage-Brings-Agentic-Communications-to-Millions-of-Developers-with-=
Vonage-API-Power-for-Kiro/aab35661-475c-47ae-930c-8bcde3e8901f/" class=3D"e=
